@model NA.PMS.OnlineScheme.SchemeFormViewModel
@using NA.PMS.Common
@using Kendo.Mvc.UI

<style type="text/css">
    .RBank {
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    .banklogo {
        /*width: 125px;*/
        height: 15px;
    }

    .banklbl {
        margin-left: -28px;
    }
</style>

@*kendo Pop Up Choose Payment Option*@
<div class="col-md-12" id="divPaymentwindow" style="background: url(/Content/Images/boxed-bg.jpg) repeat; min-height:300px;">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.ApplicationFormId)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.SchemeId)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.ChallanAccountNo)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.ChallanBranchName)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.ChallanBranchId)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.BankIFSCCode)
            @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.VirtualAccPrefix)
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row row-payment-type">
        <div class="inr-bx" style="">
            <div class="form-bx">
                <div class="row" style="margin-top:25px;">
                    <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group" style="text-align:center">
                        <label class="RBank">Payment mode</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group banklbl" id="PaymentMode">
                        <label class="RBank">@Html.RadioButtonFor(m => m.PaymentTypeId, "1", new { @class = "", @checked = true, @id = "PaymentOnline" }) Online</label>
                        <label class="RBank">@Html.RadioButtonFor(m => m.PaymentTypeId, "2", new { @class = "", @id = "PaymentOffline" }) RTGS/NEFT Challan</label>                        
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 form-group" id="div-online-payment">
            <div class="inr-bx" style="">
                <div class="form-bx">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group" style="text-align:center">
                            <label class="RBank">Select Gateway</label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                            <label class="banklbl">
                                <input type="radio" name="BankType" value="1" checked="checked" />
                                <img class="banklogo" src="~/Content/Images/Payment/BankLogo/indus-1.png" />
                            </label>
                            <label class="banklbl">
                                <input type="radio" name="BankType" value="2" />
                                <img class="banklogo" style="height: 20px;" src="~/Content/Images/Payment/BankLogo/hdfc.png" />
                            </label>
                            <label class="banklbl">
                                <input type="radio" name="BankType" value="3" />
                                <img class="banklogo" style="height: 22px;" src="~/Content/Images/Payment/BankLogo/icici.png" />
                            </label>
                            <label class="banklbl">
                                <input type="radio" name="BankType" value="4" />
                                <img class="banklogo" style="height: 22px;" src="~/Content/Images/Payment/BankLogo/bank_of_baroda_logo.png" />
                            </label>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 form-group text-center">
                            <input type="button" id="btn-online-payment" value="Submit" class="btn btn-add" />
                            <input type="button" id="btn-window-close" value="Cancel" class="btn btn-default btn-close-window" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
       
        <div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 form-group" id="div-challan-payment">
            <div class="inr-bx" style="">
                <div class="form-bx">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group" style="text-align:center">
                            @Html.Label("Select Bank:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required RBank" })
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                            @{
                                if (Model.SchemeBankList != null)
                                {
                                    foreach (var item in Model.SchemeBankList)
                                    {
                                        <input type="radio" name="ChallanRTGS" value="@item.Id" checked="checked" /> @item.Text
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">

                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                            <input type="button" class="btn btn-add" id="btn-generate-challan" value="Generate Challan" />
                            <input type="button" id="btn-window-close_challan_rtgs" value="Cancel" class="btn btn-default btn-close-window" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 form-group" id="div-challan-upload-form">
            <div class="inr-bx" style="">
                <div class="form-bx" style="margin-top:20px;min-height:250px;">
                    <form action="/Online/Housing/SaveGeneratedSchemeFormChallan" enctype="multipart/form-data" id="UploadChallanForm" method="post" novalidate="novalidate">
                        @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.ApplicationFormId)
                        @Html.HiddenFor(m => m.AppType)
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.Label("Transaction Id:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.SchemePayment.TransactionId, htmlAttributes: new { @maxlength = "15", @class = "k-textbox", style = "width:100%;" })
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.Label("Trans/Challan Date:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @(Html.Kendo().DatePickerFor(model => model.SchemePayment.EntryDate).HtmlAttributes(new { style = "width:100%", @class = "input-disabled" }))
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.Label("Payment Type:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                <label style="padding-left:0;">@Html.RadioButtonFor(m => m.PayType, "RTGS", new { @class = "", @checked = true, @id = "RTGS" }) RTGS</label>
                                <label>@Html.RadioButtonFor(m => m.PayType, "Other", new { @class = "", @id = "ONLINE" }) Other</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.Label("UTR No:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required lbl-utr" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.SchemePayment.BankReferenceNo, htmlAttributes: new { @class = "k-textbox", @maxlength = "30", style = "width:100%;" })
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                @Html.Label("Upload Challan:", htmlAttributes: new { @class = "required" })
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                <input type='file' id='paid-challan-file' class='paid-challan k-textbox' name='files' onchange='CheckFilePreChallanSize(this)' style="width:100%;" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 form-group">

                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-xs-12 form-group">
                                <input type="button" class="btn btn-add btn-save-window" id="btnUploadChallan" value="Upload Paid Challan" />
                                <input type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-close-window" id="btn-close_Challan" value="Cancel" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="divPrintChallan" class="modal fade" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="myModalLabel" aria-hidden="true" style="padding-top:40px;">
    <div class="modal-dialog" style="width: 60%;">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <button type="button" class="close challanWindowClose" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
                <h4 class="modal-title">  <b>Challan</b></h4>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" style="overflow:auto; height:400px;">
                <div id="divChallanBody"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer" style="text-align: center;">
                <button type="submit" id="btnPrintDiv" class="k-button" data-dismiss="modal" onclick="PrintchallanDiv();">Print</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
    $("#div-online-payment").show();
    //$("#OfflinePayment").hide();
    $("#div-challan-payment").hide();
    $("#div-challan-upload-form").hide();

    $(document).ready(function () {
        $('input:radio[name=PayType]').on('change', function () {
            var formType = $('input[name=PayType]:checked').val();
            if (formType.trim() == "RTGS") {
                $(".lbl-utr").html("UTR No");
            }
            else {
                $(".lbl-utr").html("Bank Reference No");
            }
        });

        //$("input[type='radio'][name=BankType][value=3]").attr("disabled", "disabled");
        //Disable Bank In RTGS
        // $("input[type='radio'][name=ChallanRTGS][value=67]").attr("disabled", "disabled");//HDFC
        $("input[type='radio'][name=ChallanRTGS][value=48]").attr("disabled", "disabled");//ICICI
        // $("input[type='radio'][name=ChallanRTGS][value=74]").attr("disabled", "disabled");//INDUSIND
        $('#divPaymentwindow').kendoWindow({
            modal: true,
            title: "Online Payment",
            visible: false,
            position: {
                top: 60, // or "100px"
                left: "30%"
            },
            width: "50%", height: "auto"
        });

        $('#btn-online-payment').click(function () {
            var BankType = $('input[name=BankType]:checked').val();
            if (BankType.trim() != "") {
                var formId = $("#ApplicationFormId").val();
                window.location.href = '@Url.Action("OnlinePayment", "Payment", new { area = "Online"})' + "/?id=" + formId + "&banktype=" + BankType;
            }
            else {
                alertify.success("Select Bank.");
                return false;
            }
        });

        $('#PaymentMode input:radio[name=PaymentTypeId]').on('change', function () {
            var formType = $('input[name=PaymentTypeId]:checked', '#PaymentMode').val();
            if (formType.trim() == "1") {
                $("#div-online-payment").show();
                // $("#OfflinePayment").hide();
                $("#div-challan-payment").hide();
                $("#div-challan-upload-form").hide();

            } else if (formType.trim() == "2") {
                //$("#OfflinePayment").show();
                $("#div-online-payment").hide();
                $("#div-challan-payment").show();
                $("#div-challan-upload-form").hide();
            }
            else if (formType.trim() == "3") {
                $("#div-online-payment").hide();
                $("#div-challan-payment").hide();
                $("#div-challan-upload-form").show();
            }
            else {
                alertify.success("Select payment Method.");
                return false;
            }
        });

        $('.btn-close-window').click(function () {
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
        });

        //$("#btn-window-close").click(function () {
        //    $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
        //});

        //$("#btn-window-close_challan").click(function () {
        //    $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
        //});

        //$("#btn-window-close_challan_rtgs").click(function () {
        //    $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
        //});

        //$("#btn-window-close_uploadPreChallan").click(function () {
        //    $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
        //});

        $(".challanWindowClose").click(function () {
            window.location.href = '@Url.Action("SchemeInformation", "Application", new { area = "Online"})';
        });

        $("#btnPayment").click(function () {
            var formId = $("#ApplicationFormId").val();
            var type = "Payment";
            $('.row-payment-type').show();
            $("#div-online-payment").show();
            $("#div-challan-payment").hide();
            $("#div-challan-upload-form").hide();
           // ValidatePayment(formId, type);
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").center();
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").open();
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").pin();
        });

        $("#btn-upload-challan").click(function () {
            var formId = $("#ApplicationFormId").val();
            $('.row-payment-type').hide();
            $("#div-online-payment").hide();
            $("#div-challan-payment").hide();
            $("#div-challan-upload-form").show();

            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").center();
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").open();
            $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").pin();
        });
    });

    var specialKeys = new Array();
    specialKeys.push(8); //Backspace
    function IsNumeric(e) {
        var keyCode = e.which ? e.which : e.keyCode
        var ret = ((keyCode >= 48 && keyCode <= 57) || specialKeys.indexOf(keyCode) != -1);
        if (ret == false)
            return false;
    }

    $("#btnUploadChallan").click(function () {
        bflag = true;
        var transactionId = $("#PaymentModel_TransactionId").val();
        var amount = $("#PaymentModel_Amount").val();
        var entryDate = $("#PaymentModel_EntryDate").val();
        var bankName = $("#PaymentModel_BankName").val();
        var challanFile = $("#paid-challan-file").val();

        if (transactionId == "") {
            alertify.error("Please enter transaction/challan Id.");
            return bflag = false;
        }
        else if (amount == "") {
            alertify.error("Please enter amount.");
            return bflag = false;
        }
        else if (entryDate == "") {
            alertify.error("Please enter transaction/challan date.");
            return bflag = false;
        }
        else if (bankName == "") {
            alertify.error("Please enter bank name.");
            return bflag = false;
        }
        else if (challanFile == '') {
            return alertify.error("Please upload challan/transaction reciept.");
        }

        $("#UploadChallanForm").submit();
        bflag = true;
    });

    $("#btn-generate-challan").click(function () {
        var formModel = {
            ApplicationFormId: $("#ApplicationFormId").val(),
            SchemeId: $("#SchemeId").val(),
            BankId: $('input[name=ChallanRTGS]:checked').val(),
            ActionType: 'TemplateChallan'
        };
        GenerateChallanByTemplate(formModel);
    });

    //Re-Print Challan
    $("#btn-reprint-challan").click(function () {
        var formModel = {
            ApplicationFormId: $("#ApplicationFormId").val(),
            SchemeId: $("#SchemeId").val(),
            BankId: $('input[name=ChallanRTGS]:checked').val(),
            ActionType: 'TemplateChallan'
        };
        GenerateChallanByTemplate(formModel);
    });

    function GenerateChallanByTemplate(formModel) {
        if (formModel != null && formModel != undefined) {
            $.ajax({
                dataType: 'json',
                type: 'Post',
                contentType: 'application/json; charset=utf-8',
                data: JSON.stringify(formModel),
                url: '/Online/Housing/GenerateSchemeFormChallanByTemplate',
                success: function (result) {
                    $("#divPaymentwindow").data("kendoWindow").close();
                    $("#divChallanBody").html(result);
                    $("#divPrintChallan").modal('show');
                },
                error: function (objAjaxRequest, strError) {
                    var respText = objAjaxRequest.responseText;
                    alertify.error("Provider failed to create challan.");
                }
            });
        }
        else {
            alertify.alert("Challan Information!","Network error ")
        }
        
    }

    function FilterbankId() {
        return { bankId: $("#ChallanBankId").val() };
    }

    function FilterSchemeID() {
        return { schemeId: $("#SchemeId").val() };
    }

    function PrintchallanDiv() {
        var contents = document.getElementById("divChallanBody").innerHTML;
        var frame1 = document.createElement('iframe');
        frame1.name = "frame1";
        frame1.style.position = "absolute";
        frame1.style.top = "-1000000px";
        document.body.appendChild(frame1);
        var frameDoc = frame1.contentWindow ? frame1.contentWindow : frame1.contentDocument.document ? frame1.contentDocument.document : frame1.contentDocument;
        frameDoc.document.open();
        frameDoc.document.write('<html><head><title></title>');
        frameDoc.document.write('<link href="/Content/CSS/font-awesome.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>');
        frameDoc.document.write('</head><body>');
        frameDoc.document.write(contents);
        frameDoc.document.write('</body></html>');
        frameDoc.document.close();
        setTimeout(function () {
            window.frames["frame1"].focus();
            window.frames["frame1"].print();
            document.body.removeChild(frame1);
        }, 500);
        return false;
    }

    $('#divPrintChallan').on('hidden.bs.modal', function () {
        ClearFieldValue();
    });

    function ClearFieldValue() {
        $("#ChallanBankId").data("kendoDropDownList").value("");
        $("#ChallanBranchId").data("kendoDropDownList").value("");
        $("#ChallanAccountNo").val('');
    }

    $("#paid-challan-file").change(function () {
        CheckFileSizePCExt(this);
    });

    function CheckFileSizePCExt(input) {
        var file = input.files[0].name;
        var fileSize = input.files[0].size / 1024 //Size in KB
        var count = file.lastIndexOf('.') + 1;
        var ext = file.substr(count);
        if (ext == "pdf") {
            if (fileSize < 10) {
                IsError = false;
                alertify.error(file + " Min 10kb file size is allowed");
                return false;
            }
            if (fileSize / 1024 > 5) {
                IsError = false;
                alertify.error(file + " Max 5Mb file size is allowed");
                return false;
            }
        }
        else {
            alertify.error("Only jpg, png, jpeg & pdf file allowed.");
            return false;
        }
    }

    var IsError = false;
    function CheckFilePreChallanSize(row) {
        var filename = row.files[0].name;
        var size = row.files[0].size / 1024;
        var extension = filename.substr(filename.lastIndexOf('.') + 1);
        if (extension.toLowerCase() == "pdf") {
            if (size / 1024 > 6) {
                IsError = true;
                alertify.error("Maximum 5Mb file size is allowed");
            }
            if (IsError == true) {
                row.value = '';
            }
        }
        else {
            alertify.error("Please upload pdf documents.");
            row.value = '';
        }
    }
</script>